-atlas/montana/silver-bow-county"],["ARC or PLC in Silver Bow County","/arc-plc/montana/silver-bow-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Silver Bow County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those 75 years. In 2025, June to July landed at 51% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 30971 had its driest year in 2021 at 58% of normal.</p>"}
